{#
   Testers Wanted (#testers). Reworked to the design's three cards: Android,
   iOS TestFlight, Talk to us.

   The old "perks for active testers" card is folded into the TestFlight card
   rather than dropped — the boosted-kitty figure is read from StarterConfig, so
   it is a real number and the only concrete incentive on the page.

   The store links carry data-store-link, like every other store CTA (see
   landing.js for why that replaced hardcoded element ids, and for the five
   roles). This section carries both "missing" fallbacks: android-missing and
   ios-fallback appear only for a platform with no URL, so the cards always
   offer a route even before the store listings exist.
#}
<section class="testers-section" id="testers" aria-labelledby="testers-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Testers Wanted</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="testers-title">HELP US BREAK IT</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Android is live on Google Play and iOS is available through TestFlight. We want people who will actually play a season, file the odd bug and tell us when something feels wrong.</p>

        <div class="testers-grid">
            <article class="pillar-card">
                <h3 class="pillar-title">ANDROID</h3>
                <p>Live on Google Play now.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-gold" data-store-link="android" style="display:none">GET IT ON GOOGLE PLAY</a>
                <p class="testers-pending" data-store-link="android-missing" style="display:none">Not yet available — <button type="button" class="link-button" onclick="openBetaModal()">ask us for access</button>.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="pillar-card">
                <h3 class="pillar-title">iOS TESTFLIGHT</h3>
                <p>Join the TestFlight build. Testers get in before general release — and we are planning rewards for the ones who stick with it, starting with a transfer kitty well above the standard £{{ world.starter.startingBalance|number_format }} start.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline" data-store-link="ios" style="display:none">JOIN ON TESTFLIGHT</a>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-store-link="ios-fallback" style="display:none" onclick="openBetaModal()">REQUEST TESTFLIGHT ACCESS</button>
            </article>

            <article class="pillar-card">
                <h3 class="pillar-title">TALK TO US</h3>
                <p>Email <a href="mailto:admin@buildmyclub.co.uk">admin@buildmyclub.co.uk</a> with your device and how much football management you have played. We read every one.</p>
                <a href="mailto:admin@buildmyclub.co.uk?subject=Build%20My%20Club%20—%20tester%20application" class="btn btn-outline">EMAIL THE TEAM</a>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
